// mautrix-meta builds against Beeper's fork of this HTTP library, and a replace does not carry over from a module
// that is only required: without the same line here the build takes the original, which no longer compiles with the
// QUIC library mautrix-meta asks for.
replace github.com/imroc/req/v3 => github.com/beeper/req/v3 v3.0.0-20260925135712-b49593750e56
